+	 * bytes at DMA_BASE) with other payloads, fired by the DMA SW trigger (0x90, which the boot loader left at 1).
+	 * Test 1 (all pixels on, 0x23, then normal 0x13) is visible if the path reaches the panel at all; test 2 dims
